refused: d138_the_two_kinds_dont_mix.cy:8:52, line 8 column 52
 8 |     let $o: std::map.ordered<key: str, val: i32> = Give $h;
   |                                                    ^^^^^^^
 what: this is `std::map.hash<key: str, val: i32>`, where `std::map.ordered<key: str, val: i32>` is needed
 why:  `:` doesn't convert, and `as` builds a new value of another type (D7)
